      "WAKS, I\nIne American Ambassador Mr. CLaude G. Bowers was at\nLos Cerrillos Airport to greet Mr. Roig and Mr. Lee. From lett\nto right: Mr. Roig, Mr. Bowers and Mr. Lee.",
